543 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Trained on Google Colab, the Hybrid CNN-LSTM model leverages CNNs to extract spatial features from vehicle states \(position, velocity, heading, relative distance\) and LSTMs to model temporal dependencies, making it ideal for predicting future velocities from sequential LiDAR data.)
